*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* SELECTION-SCREEN
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
"향후 권한 연동하여 User 별 Defalut 값 관리 시 Display 필드로 변경(BUKRS/WERKS)
SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK1 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S01.
  PARAMETERS     : P_BUKRS LIKE T001-BUKRS OBLIGATORY,
                   P_WERKS LIKE LIPS-WERKS OBLIGATORY.
  SELECT-OPTIONS : S_LFDAT  FOR LIKP-LFDAT OBLIGATORY,
                   S_IPDAT  FOR LIKP-LFDAT,
                   S_VBELN  FOR LIKP-VBELN,
                   S_MATNR  FOR LIPS-MATNR, "MARA
                   S_LIFNR  FOR LIKP-LIFNR, "LFA1
                   S_EMLIF  FOR LIKP-LIFNR. "LFA1
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK1.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK2 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S02.
  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    PARAMETERS : P_ALL RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR1 USER-COMMAND EXE.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 6.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R01 FOR FIELD P_ALL.
    PARAMETERS : P_YGR RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR1.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 30.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R02 FOR FIELD P_YGR.
    PARAMETERS : P_NGR RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR1 DEFAULT 'X'.
    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 54.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R03 FOR FIELD P_NGR.
  SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF LINE.
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK2.
